{%- when 'i0' -%}<p>Each June piece is eligible for a 50% buy back and 100% exchange.&nbsp;</p> 
<p>&nbsp;</p> 
<p><strong>BUYBACK</strong><br> The buyback value is based on the current value of the precious metals in your June piece at the time of return. We guarantee a minimum 50% buyback. If gold prices increase over time, your buyback value may increase too.</p> 
<p>&nbsp;</p> 
<p><strong>EXCHANGE</strong><br> As your style evolves, your jewellery can too. If you'd like to try a different June piece, you can exchange your current one and receive 100% of its value towards another design.</p>
{%- when 'i1' -%}<p><strong>DELIVERY</strong></p> 
<p>Orders are usually delivered within 4–7 working days. Custom or personalised orders may take up to 10 working days and go into production once the design render is approved.</p> 
<p>&nbsp;</p> 
<p><strong>RETURNS</strong></p> 
<p>Returns may be requested within&nbsp;<strong>7 days of delivery</strong>&nbsp;for unused pieces in their original condition and packaging. Custom or personalised pieces are non-returnable unless damaged or defective. Non-product charges are non-refundable.&nbsp;</p> 
<p>Returns can be initiated through our online&nbsp;<a href="https://www.shop-june.com/returnportal" target="_blank">return portal.</a></p> 
<p>&nbsp;</p> 
<p><strong>ORDER CANCELLATIONS</strong></p> 
<p>Orders may be cancelled within&nbsp;<strong>24 hours of purchase</strong>. Custom or personalised orders cannot be cancelled once production begins.</p> 
<p>For assistance, contact&nbsp;<strong>care@houseofjune.co</strong>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<strong>@weare.june</strong>.</p>
